        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: William Shakespeare, Ferdinand Gottschalk\n- Works: Othello, The Tempest, Arrow in the Air, Catch My Soul\n- Roles: Ferdinand\n- Topics: adaptations, authorship\n\nFacts:\n- William Shakespeare wrote Othello.\n- William Shakespeare also wrote The Tempest.\n- Ferdinand Gottschalk was a television actor active in 1948.\n- Ferdinand Gottschalk starred in Arrow in the Air and played Ferdinand in that work.\n- The play performed by Ferdinand Gottschalk in Arrow in the Air was The Tempest.\n- Othello was adapted into the 1974 film Catch My Soul.",
